       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MAINPROG.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 X   PIC 9(4) VALUE 7.
       01 Y   PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "SQUARER" USING X Y
           DISPLAY X " squared is " Y
           CALL "SQUARER" USING BY CONTENT X BY REFERENCE Y
           DISPLAY Y
           STOP RUN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SQUARER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 IN-VAL   PIC 9(4).
       01 OUT-VAL  PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING IN-VAL OUT-VAL.
           COMPUTE OUT-VAL = IN-VAL * IN-VAL
           EXIT PROGRAM.
       END PROGRAM SQUARER.
